{"title":"The Heavenly Demon Wants A Quiet Life","synopsis":"Dari Studio yang membawakan The Return Of the Crazy Demon Absolute Regression dan masih banyak lagi\nDi kehidupanku yang selanjutnya aku ingin menyusuri jalan yang benarbenar berdeda dari ini\nSang Heavenly Demon yang semasa hidupnya ditakuti dan dihormati mendapatkan petunjuk penting untuk bisa menguasai teknik SoulAugmenting Demonic Art pada saat momen kematiannya\nTeknik SoulAugmenting Demonic Art bukan hanya tentang memakan jiwa orang lain Sang Heavenly Demon kemudian terbangun pada tubuh Byeok Taesan seorang bangsawan muda yang lemah dan bisa mati kapan saja\nUntuk bertahan hidup dia harus pergi ke rumah bordil Sang Heavenly Demon yang kini menjelma menjadi Raja Malammemulai perjalanan hidupnya yang penuh ambisi","alternative_title":"천마는 조용히 살고싶다","author":"Gijema, Kim Kang-hyun","artist":"Slow","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"chapters":[{"id":"e8b6499c-156b-40a3-94d8-999f56824955","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"24681667-792e-44b0-a15f-391ec33c4017","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"id":"b246d2bb-25a0-4763-abe4-1712a1d16693","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"id":"37a0f312-fd7b-468a-91f0-024d34888464","number":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-07-09","images":[]},{"id":"63993c79-8afe-4225-b3b7-a024dfa036f9","number":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-07-02","images":[]},{"id":"152e2890-29dd-4a9f-afff-4909cab83b0a","number":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"d172d76b-aeba-4014-89c7-6be1835cb4fe","number":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"26d1f534-ad06-492d-9e64-18d1ef7c0714","number":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"id":"bf8bb245-a6c8-421b-81a6-254fdeec068b","number":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-05-29","images":[]},{"id":"2cc0d3b4-c7fe-4bdb-b4ac-3f29ab00115b","number":"82","title"